flowchart TB
    A[gcc -shared -fPIC] --> B[Compile with PIC]
    B --> C[foo.o bar.o baz.o]
    C --> D[Link into shared library]
    D --> E[libfoo.so.1.0.0]
    
    E --> F{Add SONAME}
    F -->|Yes| G[gcc -Wl,-soname,libfoo.so.1]
    F -->|No| H[No version control]
    
    G --> I[Create symlinks, ln -s libfoo.so.1.0.0 libfoo.so.1, ln -s libfoo.so.1 libfoo.so]
    
    I --> J[Runtime uses SONAME]
    I --> K[Linker uses .so]
    
    J --> L[Library loading]
    K --> M[Compilation]
    
    style E fill:#c8e6c9
    style G fill:#bbdefb
    style H fill:#ffccbc
